# Follow project context

Read and obey `.cursor/CONTEXT.md` for every task. It applies to all sub-folders under `.cursor/` (`rules/`, `hooks/`, `skills/`, `commands/`).

- Product truth is `docs/mvp/`, not guesses.
- Architecture truth is `docs/architecture/`. Do not invent a stack.
- Use `rules/frontend/` when touching UI. Use `rules/backend/` when touching APIs, booking state, or data.
- Use skills and slash commands listed in CONTEXT.md instead of inventing a parallel workflow.
